	<div class="modal fade in show" id="exampleModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">

		<div class="modal-dialog modal-md">

			<div class="modal-content">

				<div class="modal-header">

					<h5 class="modal-title" id="exampleModalLabel" style="color: #991b30;">Public Notice</h5>

					<button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>

				</div>

				<div class="modal-body">

					<div class="col-md-12 home_modal">



						<p>Dear Users,</p>

						<p>Student Exchange programs / Acdemic Credit Mapping / Transfer Admissions Only Through Official University Channels</p>

						<p>The global university, Arunachal Pradesh hereby informs all prospective students, parents, and the general public that the University does not authorize any external agency, consultancy, agent, or individual to collect fees, process applications, or grant admission on its behalf.</p>
						<p>Admissions are conducted only through the official University website and the University’s Admission/Information Office.</p>
						<p>No private person, education agent, coaching centre, consultancy firm, or organization is permitted to offer admission, guarantee seats, or collect any payment in the name of the Global university Arunachal Pradesh.</p>
						<p>The University will not be responsible for any loss of money, documents, or opportunities arising from dealing with unauthorized persons or agencies.</p>
						<p>For all admission-related information, applicants must contact only the University through the details provided on the official website:</p>
						<p>Official website:<a style="font-weight:600;color: #991b30;" href="https://www.tgu.ac.in/">https://www.tgu.ac.in/</a></p>
						<p>Official Email: <a style="font-weight:600;color: #991b30;" href="mailto:info@tgu.ac.in">info@tgu.ac.in</a></p>

					</div>

				</div>

			</div>

		</div>

	</div>

